The circuit construction
needs one finite quantity, the adjacent pairing
$$
\begin{aligned}
S_{T,N}&:=\sum_{j=1}^N
 \mathbb E[F_Ng_j]\,\mathbb E[F_NZ_{j+1}],\\
\lim_{N\to\infty}S_{T,N}
&=I_T:=\int_0^T\mathbb E[a(t,X_t)]\,dt.
\end{aligned}                                      \tag{11}
$$

